# Exact immutable 16-byte review bytes. Cross-checked by the *real JS outbox*
# and consumed byte-for-byte by the real Rust review gate. No live QUIC traffic.
# Format: LABEL HEX; v2 type 0x11 EVENT, v2 type 0x12 ACK.
